# Trained model binaries are regenerable with `python -m scripts.train` and total ~13 MB, so
# they are not committed. models/metrics.json IS committed: it is the machine-readable record
# of every metric the README cites, and the ML layer degrades gracefully when the binaries
# are absent (the physics path never depends on them).
models/*.joblib

# TypeScript incremental build cache
*.tsbuildinfo
